        {
            "collapsed": false,
            "id": "d5ee75cfe6",
            "info": "A clade which contains important components of the bacterial community inside mammalian reproductive tracts and inside all chordate digestive tracts. Historically important to humans for driving the fermentation process behind yoghurt, cheese, sauerkraut, kimchi, pickles, salami, pepperoni, sourdough bread, and some types of beer and wine.",
